ckground:#4ADE80;box-shadow:0 2px 10px #4ADE8088\">Вълшебна гора</div></div><div class=\"p-5 flex flex-col flex-1 bg-white\"><div class=\"text-xs font-semibold mb-2\" style=\"color:#4ADE80\">Приказка за <!-- -->Ева<!-- -->, <!-- -->5 год.</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-base leading-snug mb-3\" style=\"color:#1A0533\">Ева и Говорещата Гора</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#6B5A8A;font-style:italic;flex-grow:1\">“<!-- -->Гората зад дома на Ева пазеше тайна — такава, която само тя можеше да открие. И точно тя я откри...<!-- -->”</p></div></div><div class=\"group rounded-3xl overflow-hidden card-hover flex flex-col\" style=\"box-shadow:0 8px 48px #A78BFA22, 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08)\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(145deg, #020617 0%, #1e1b4b 60%, #7C3AED 100%)\"><div class=\"absolute rounded-full animate-twinkle\" style=\"width:2px;height:2px;background:white;opacity:0.7352094571458434;top:75.39660686284597%;left:47.63129302421185%;animation-delay:1.282846215859086s\"></div><div class=\"absolute rounded-full animate-twinkle\" style=\"width:2px;height:2px;background:white;opacity:0.6068239655898353;top:51.80705069986571%;left:65.06024095769331%;animation-delay:1.80879420411599s\"></div><div class=\"absolute rounded-full animate-twinkle\" style=\"width:2px;height:3px;background:white;opacity:0.6092470568755278;top:54.79937158666699%;left:40.13629007044165%;animation-delay:1.48206564137439s\"></div><div class=\"absolute rounded-full animate-twinkle\" style=\"width:3px;height:3px;background:white;opacity:0.46117309349710345;top:88.71658387668147%;left:60.51015315283015%;animation-delay:0.9014172129129758s\"></div><div class=\"absolute rounded-full animate-twinkle\" style=\"width:3px;height:3px;background:white;opacity:0.5456461741373879;top:83.4176733293645%;left:42.66518699072331%;animation-delay:0.2836457